    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nLocated in a courtyard style development, in the heart of Shannon town centre, just a short stroll to all major industrial zones, Shannon International Airport, ease of access to the M18 for those commuting to Limerick, Ennis and Galway, number 28 offers a bright, spacious and well proportioned two bedroom ground floor apartment with open plan living/dining extending via arch to modern fitted kitchen which further connects to a private, rear garden/patio. Two double bedrooms, with master bedroom being ensuite and main bathroom round off the internal accommodation with features such as extensive timber flooring, ceiling to floor tiling in ensuite and bathroom, wood surround fireplace, broadband connectivity points and ample parking are just some of the highlights. This would be ideal for the retired couple, investor or first time buyer with viewing highly recommended and strictly by prior appointment with sole selling agent. PSL 002295"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hallway - 6.6m x 1m\nOak style timber flooring, storage closet and doors connecting to bedrooms one and two and open plan living/dining.\n\nLiving/Dining - 6.55m x 3.7m\nLiving area - oak style timber flooring, wood surround feature fireplace with polished flag and electric fire insert, tv and broadband connectivity points, glass panel door leading to private rear patio and open plan to dining area.Dining area - oak style timber flooring, built in corner unit providing storage and gas boiler with open arch to kitchen.\n\nKitchen - 2.85m x 2.6m\nModern ivory style built in wall and base units with ample work surfaces, single drainer sink with mixer tap, tiled splashback surround, ceramic tiled flooring, space and plumbing for electrical appliances and undercounter lighting.\n\nBathroom - 2.7m x 1.95m\nLow level WC, wash hand basin with overhead wall mounted mirror unit, panel bath with overhead pumped shower, glass panel shower door and quality bordered ceiling to floor tiling.\n\nBedroom One - 3.25m x 2.7m\nOak style timber flooring, telephone point and connecting door to ensuite.\n\nEnsuite - 2.66m x 0.9m\nLow level WC, wash hand basin with overhead wall mounted mirror unit and shaver light, shower tray with overhead electric shower and foldaway glass panel shower door and quality bordered ceiling to floor tiling.\n\nBedroom Two - 3.7m x 2.65m\nOak style timber flooring, broadband connectivity and tv point.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Eircode V14H395</li><li> Total Floor Space 66.71 m2</li><li> Built 2005</li><li> Mains Water</li><li> Mains Sewage</li><li> Mains Gas Central Heating</li><li> Fibre Broadband</ul>"
      },
